cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TracEHR in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TracEHR: Autoregressive Transformer Training & Inference for Electronic Health Records"
abstract: >-
  TracEHR trains causal decoder (GPT-style) transformers on patients'
  electronic health records in the MEDS format, predicting the next clinical
  event and, optionally, its timing. The trained model is then evaluated,
  used to generate future events, to extract patient embeddings, and to
  predict binary, multiclass, continuous and survival outcomes by probing or
  fine-tuning.
authors:
